%% BL-698 / BL-704 — Cursor Remote inbound flow
flowchart TD
  A[Telegram update] --> B{Cursor Remote topic + principal?}
  B -->|no| Z[ignore / refuse]
  B -->|yes| C{callback?}
  C -->|confirm / cancel| D[operator confirm gate]
  C -->|Stop and run / Run anyway| E[special callback]
  C -->|text| F{slash verb?}
  F -->|/pilot| G[swarm-live + holiday gates]
  F -->|operator verb| H[danger tier]
  F -->|plain / photo| I[Cursor prompt]
  H -->|read| J[execute]
  H -->|soft/hard| K[prompt Confirm]
  K --> D
  D --> J
  G -->|refuse| L[buttons]
  G -->|ok| M[Cursor /pilot expedition]
  J --> N[/autopilot land hydrate shift holiday/]
